      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it sounds like the Belgians were pretty much just trying to protect their own interests through manipulation. given how much they were trying to block the movement, do you think the Belgian colonial administration's actions made actual independence inevitable? like, was their repression just fueling the fire for the nationalists to take over?",
