    "summary": "The user guides the assistant through a research inquiry regarding the decolonization of the Belgian Congo, specifically requesting a narrative centered on Congolese nationalist perspectives. The assistant complies with these constraints and eventually provides a normative assessment of whether Belgian repression made independence inevitable, concluding that it did.",
